direction right
colorMode pastel
styleMode shadow
typeface clean

Customer [icon: user]

Client Applications {
  Bookstore Frontend [icon: react, label: "Bookstore / OrderFlow frontend :5174"]
}

Order Pipeline Backend [icon: spring, color: green] {
  REST API [icon: api, label: "Spring Boot REST API :8080"]
  Order Service [icon: settings, label: "OrderService"]
  Six Step Processor [icon: settings, label: "Template + Audit Decorator"]
  Hosted Payment Service [icon: settings, label: "HostedPaymentService"]
  Webhook and Reconciliation [icon: settings, label: "Webhook validation + status reconciliation"]
  Observer Events [icon: settings, label: "After-commit completion event"]
  Shipping Observer [icon: settings]
  Email Observer [icon: settings]
  Notification Service [icon: settings]
}

MySQL 8 [icon: mysql, color: blue] {
  Customers [icon: database]
  Books [icon: database]
  Orders [icon: database]
  Order Items [icon: database]
  Audit Logs [icon: database]
  Notifications [icon: database]
}

External Services {
  Fapshi Hosted Checkout [icon: payment, label: "Fapshi API + hosted Mobile Money checkout"]
  USD XAF Primary Rate [icon: globe, label: "Open ER API"]
  USD XAF Fallback Rate [icon: globe, label: "Daily currency API"]
  Customer Browser Return [icon: globe, label: "Configured frontend return URL"]
}

Customer > Bookstore Frontend: browse, place order, checkout, monitor
Bookstore Frontend > REST API: /api and /fapshi_demo via Vite proxy
REST API > Order Service: order, catalogue, audit, notification endpoints
Order Service > Six Step Processor: transactional order creation
Six Step Processor > Books: inventory and current catalogue prices
Six Step Processor > Order Items: persist quantity and line totals
Order Service > Customers: persist customer
Order Service > Orders: persist order and status
Six Step Processor > Audit Logs: append STARTED, PENDING, SUCCESS, FAILED events
Six Step Processor > Hosted Payment Service: calculate XAF and initiate checkout
Hosted Payment Service > USD XAF Primary Rate: fetch current USD/XAF rate
Hosted Payment Service > USD XAF Fallback Rate: fallback when primary unavailable
Hosted Payment Service > Fapshi Hosted Checkout: create hosted payment and redirect URL
Fapshi Hosted Checkout > Customer Browser Return: browser redirect with orderId
Fapshi Hosted Checkout > Webhook and Reconciliation: POST webhook with shared secret
Bookstore Frontend > REST API: POST reconcile-payment and poll pending order
REST API > Webhook and Reconciliation: verify webhook or reconcile by order ID
Webhook and Reconciliation > Fapshi Hosted Checkout: query authoritative payment status
Webhook and Reconciliation > Orders: match transaction ID, reference, amount; update payment
Webhook and Reconciliation > Audit Logs: record payment result
Webhook and Reconciliation > Six Step Processor: continue confirm and complete after verified success
Six Step Processor > Observer Events: publish only on order completion
Observer Events > Shipping Observer: after transaction commit
Observer Events > Email Observer: after transaction commit
Shipping Observer > Notification Service: record simulated shipping outcome
Email Observer > Notification Service: record simulated email outcome
Notification Service > Notifications: insert once per order and notification type
REST API > Audit Logs: read order timeline
REST API > Notifications: read observer outcomes
